# ClientiAffidabili.it Docker build context hygiene
# Keep host/Windows artifacts out of Linux builder stages. pnpm node_modules contains
# symlinks/shims that can break nest/next inside Docker when copied from the host.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
playwright-report
test-results
artifacts/qa/*.log
artifacts/qa/*latest*.json
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
